silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_15_witness_traceability_sections_02_witness_chain_protocol_decomposition_step_2__step_extract__verbatim_copy;_paraphrase__marked_alternative_with_ a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "The extract gate has two modes: verbatim (default) and marked paraphrase (allowed only with explicit label, original key, and force-preservation). Verbatim extraction copies the exact text character-by-character. Marked paraphrase is allowed when labeled as interpretation_kind=source-leg-with-paraphrase-note. Unmarked paraphrase presented as verbatim is source-lying." .
